name penrose
category Package
revision 57508
shortdesc A TikZ library for producing Penrose tilings
longdesc This package provides a TikZ library for drawing Penrose tiles.
longdesc It currently supports the kite/dart, rhombus, and pentagon tile
longdesc sets. There are two main methods for their placement: one that
longdesc automatically generates a tiling, and one that allows for "by
longdesc hand" placement. Furthermore, the tiles themselves can be
longdesc deformed and will still (hopefully!) fit together in the
longdesc correct fashion.
